{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Who should be asked for input on each person: only their manager, or also two or three colleagues and anyone they manage?","Do the skill rows match what your organisation actually reviews against for this role?","Will the employee see the answers word for word, as a summary, or only through their manager?","Do colleagues know the goals well enough to comment on them, or should that stay with the manager as it does here?"],"howToUseResponses":"Filter the responses by the employee's name and read them side by side before the review. Look for points that more than one person raises, since those carry more weight than a single comment, and note where the manager's view differs from colleagues'. Turn the work examples into specific praise and the \"one thing to improve\" answers into one or two development goals. Respect the sharing choice each person made when you pass their words on.","customizeSteps":["Rename the skill rows to your organisation's competencies or values, and add the review period to the greeting.","Replace the name question with a dropdown of the people being reviewed this cycle if you run it for a whole team.","Send each reviewer the link a week or two before the review meeting, and remind them that examples matter more than ratings."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should an employee performance survey include?","a":"Progress against agreed goals, a real example of the person's work, ratings on the skills the role needs, and one specific thing that would make them more effective."},{"q":"Who should give feedback on an employee's performance?","a":"Their manager at least, and ideally a few colleagues who work with them closely. This template asks each person how they work with the employee, so their answers can be read in that light."},{"q":"Should performance feedback from colleagues be anonymous?","a":"Give people the choice. Some are more candid without their name attached, others are happy to stand behind their words. The last question lets each reviewer decide."},{"q":"Is this the same as a self-assessment?","a":"No. This survey collects other people's view of the employee. Pair it with a self-review so the conversation can compare the two."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Performance review input","description":"Gather input from the people who work with someone, ahead of their performance review.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_employee00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hi! You've been asked for input on a colleague's performance ahead of their review. It takes about five minutes, and specific examples help far more than general praise or criticism.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_employee01","ref":"employee_name","title":"Whose performance are you giving input on?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_employee02","ref":"relationship","title":"How do you work with them?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_i_m_their","label":"I'm their manager","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_work_alongside","label":"I work alongside them on the same team","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_i_work_with","label":"I work with them from another team","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_they_manage_me","label":"They manage me","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_employee03","ref":"goals_progress","title":"How did they do against the goals you agreed for this period?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_went_beyond_them","label":"Went beyond them","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_met_them","label":"Met them","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_partly_met_them","label":"Partly met them","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_didn_t_meet","label":"Didn't meet them","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_employee04","ref":"goals_context","title":"What got in the way of the goals they didn't reach?","description":"Include anything outside their control, such as changed priorities or missing resources.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1200,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_employee05","ref":"work_example","title":"Describe one piece of their work from this period that stood out. What did they do, and what came of it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1500,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_employee06","ref":"skills","title":"From what you've seen, how do they do on each of these?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"matrix","rows":[{"id":"opt_row_quality_of","label":"Quality of their work"},{"id":"opt_row_delivering_what","label":"Delivering what they promise, on time"},{"id":"opt_row_keeping_others","label":"Keeping others informed"},{"id":"opt_row_working_with","label":"Working with people across teams"},{"id":"opt_row_solving_problems","label":"Solving problems without being asked"},{"id":"opt_row_taking_feedback","label":"Taking feedback on board"}],"columns":[{"id":"opt_col_below_what","label":"Below what the role needs"},{"id":"opt_col_getting_there","label":"Getting there"},{"id":"opt_col_what_the","label":"What the role needs"},{"id":"opt_col_beyond_what","label":"Beyond what the role needs"}],"multiplePerRow":false},{"id":"blk_employee07","ref":"under_pressure","title":"How easy are they to work with when things get busy?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":5,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"Very hard","labelHigh":"Very easy"},{"id":"blk_employee08","ref":"keep_doing","title":"What should they keep doing?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_employee09","ref":"improve","title":"What's one thing that would make them more effective? Be specific, and kind.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_employee10","ref":"develop","title":"Where do you think they'd benefit most from development?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_job_specific_skills","label":"Job-specific skills","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_leading_or_mentoring","label":"Leading or mentoring others","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_communication","label":"Communication","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_planning_and_prioritising","label":"Planning and prioritising","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_understanding_the_wider","label":"Understanding the wider business","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":2,"allowOther":true},{"id":"blk_employee11","ref":"attribution","title":"How should your input be shared with them?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_with_my_name","label":"With my name on it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_without_my_name","label":"Without my name","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_employee01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Thanks, your input is in","bodyMd":"It will be read alongside the other responses before the review, and shared the way you asked.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_employee01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"relationship"},"op":"eq","valu